void Page::SetScrollableContent(std::shared_ptr<UIElement> content);   // one line: wrap in ScrollViewer(fill)+8px  LayoutHost is a single-content host; Card is a rounded/bordered/hover card; Page is the page container for TabView / PageHost . SetContentAlignment(Center, Center) centers Page/Card content; default Stretch keeps old behaviour. With no content, explicit SetWidth/SetHeight on Card/Page still applies; a ScrollViewer without content also returns its explicit/finite viewport size. Card::UseCache() = HasShadow() ; Page::UseCache() = false.

